        U i (secondRelativeLog (secondActualNorms p (secondInheritedProfile p j.1 Ψ m z) j.2.1 j.2.2)
          G E V B (Z^N) i) = 1) →
      (∀ a,‖Ψ a‖ ≤ 1) → (∀ x∈source,‖w x‖ ≤ 1) →
