      (∀ x∈source,Z^(j-eta) ≤ ‖ringComplex (jLabel p x.cube.support
        (fun i => x.cube.leftExponent i+x.cube.rightExponent i) x.cube.leftBit x.cube.rightBit)‖^2) →
