      (∑ K : rows, ‖weightedFinitePhysicalKernelRow F K.val (hrows K.val K.property).1 S jF Pset nset bset
        (D K) s hc u m windows QK QP Qn Qb W θ T r₀ aw₀ w₀‖^2) ≤
