          (G.reflected K.val (hrows K.val K.property) (slotChoiceFamily lists hmax hgood p.val)).generator_ne_zero (hc₀ g)
          (G.reflected K.val (hrows K.val K.property) (slotChoiceFamily lists hmax hgood p.val)).generator_good
