        (Φ (‖ringComplex z‖^2/K)).re else 0)/(raw*∏i,P i)=
      «ω» z*‖(Real.sqrt (raw*∏i,P i):ℂ)⁻¹*rowPolynomial Finset.univ (sourceGenerator Q)
