  intro η₀
  filter_upwards [hbound η₀,eventually_ge_atTop (Fc*bΦ),eventually_ge_atTop (1:ℝ)] with Z hZ hconst hZ1
  intro θ w σ v t T hw hwL hσlo hσhi hT hv η Q r R hR hQM hz hex hsΦ
