    (K A₀ B₀ a T M:ℝ)(hK:0< K)(hA:0< A₀)(hB:0< B₀)(ha:0< a)(hT:0< T)
    (hl:a*T≤(C.absNorm:ℝ)*Real.exp M*A₀)(hr:a*T≤(D.absNorm:ℝ)*Real.exp M*B₀):
    ‖scalar C D hC E K A₀ B₀‖*T/((C.absNorm:ℝ)*D.absNorm)*
