    (errorGain D0 c sigma Z p k) 0 sigma (frequencyLoss Z Csec xi)
    (hw.1.trans hw.2.1) hq.1 hw.1 hsigma (frequencyLoss_nonneg Z Csec xi hZ hC hxi)
    hq.2 hD hg (by norm_num) hw.2.2

