      0≤ B → 0≤ H → 0≤ R → (η.modulus.absNorm:ℝ)≤ Z^B →
      (R0.absNorm:ℝ)≤ Z^B → H≤ Z^B → R≤ Z^B →
      H≤ Z^(5*B+1) ∧
