theorem original_exceptional_energy (wlo whi:ℝ)(hwlo:0< wlo)(hwhi:0≤ whi)(lo hi:ι→ℝ)(W:𝓢(ℝ,ℂ))
    (ε δ θ B L Cr:ℝ)(hε:0<ε)(hδ:0<δ)(hθ:0<θ)(hB:0≤ B)(hL:0≤ L)(hCr:0< Cr):
