  filter_upwards [hblock,hmass] with Z hZ hmassZ
  refine ⟨hZ.1,?_⟩
  intro s p hlo hhi hP hW1 hW2 R0 seed hR0 hseed hseed0 hcap S β χ₀ m hm hml hm2
    Tsec ξ Kphys hKphys R hR hRcap hcond r hX1 hX2 hY1 hY2
