      H j*errorPowers p (errorIndex i+1) (τ.modulus.absNorm:ℝ) Z (Kerror p i χ)
        (Mdecl-M0) paid saving (Mwidth/4-Real.logb Z (C.absNorm:ℝ)-errorRemoval p Z (errorIndex i+1)) j;
