    K H0 hK hH0 houter hHcap t seed0 hseed0 seed hseed hseedne hseedcap
    p hp₁ hp₂ hX₁ hX₂ hY₁ hY₂ Mdecl Mwidth θclip hθclip hMdecl0 hMA hlow
