      hcard hlowerSrc hupperSrc hb1 hb2 hb1max hb2max C D R0 hC hD hCD hR0 hRcap hNC E hmod
      K H0 hK hH0 houter hHcap B t hB seed hseed hseedne hseedcap p hp₁ hp₂ hX₁ hX₂ hY₁ hY₂
