      min (length Z X₁) (length Z X₂)≤ s.width/4 →
      5*s.width/6≤ length Z X₁+length Z X₂+(∑i,w i) →
      length Z X₁+length Z X₂+6*κ*(∑i,w i)≤ s.width →
