    (ι:=Fin 0) bΦ hbΦ (fun _=>1) a b B εdiag ξ saving (by simp) ha (by linarith) hB hεdiag hξ
  refine ⟨d,xi,L,hd,hxi,hxirho,hL,hLupper,Ψ,hsΨ,hnΨ,Sdiag,Stail,Cdiag,Ctail,hCd,hCt,?_⟩
