    ∀degree:ℕ,∀S:Finset (ℕ×ℕ),∀Jmass:ℕ,∀Smass:Finset (ℕ×ℕ),
    ∃Jout:ℕ,∃U:Finset (ℕ×ℕ),∃Cfixed:ℝ,0< Cfixed ∧
