          (1+|t|)^Jout*Z^(max s.width (length Z X₁+length Z X₂)+efinal):=by
  obtain ⟨du,xiu,Lu,hdu,hxiu,hxiuCap,hLu,hLuCap,huStage⟩:=
    CenteredMomentEnergyZeroUnbalancedOriginal.original_unbalanced_from_zero_low
