    exact rowMarkedTerm_step p hp hg hc eta a X W V rho hρ j e (l+2*r) k m (by omega)
  · intro r
    rw [show l+2*(r+1)=(l+2*r)+2 by omega]
    exact rowMarkedTerm_zero_lower_edge p hp hg hc eta a X W V rho j e (l+2*r) k hj (by omega)
