    (η:Ideal Eis→*ℂ)(hη:∀c,¬outside E c→η c=0)(u:Eis)(Z r z G:ℝ)(hZ:0< Z)(ell lo hi:σ→ℝ)
    (hell:∑i∈I,ell i=z-G)(jlo jhi:ℝ)
